   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">An early recovery strategy and action plan developed for the ten most-affected provinces.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">o Conduct a rapid early recovery needs assessment ahead of a Post-Disaster Needs Assessment
(or similar customized exercise) to support Government-led damage and loss assessment work
in liaison with strategic partners ensuring a participatory approach;
o Consult regularly with partners to share and collect required data and information;
o Facilitate a joint assessment of structural damage using satellite imagery and UNDP CB
expertise and UNOSAT data to support AFAD&#x2019;s assessment of damages;
o Provide technical support in drafting and developing an early recovery strategy and action plan,
in line with Government policies and strategies, and with a participatory approach.</narrative>
    </description>
