    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Priority recovery activities piloted in the ten most-affected provinces to provide proof of concept for priority areas indicated in the early recovery strategy and action plan.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">o Initiate environmentally friendly debris removal and management to recycle a majority of
rubble and mitigate the risks of disease and hazardous materials from ruined buildings;
o Rehabilitate livelihoods through emergency cash-for-work initiatives and SME support centres
offering consultancy services and other support based on a needs mapping;
o Introduce community-based service centers to address urgent needs of vulnerable groups,
including persons with disabilities, the elderly, women heading households, refugees.</narrative>
