     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coordination in early recovery efforts among central and local authorities and international actors supported and improved for the ten most-affected provinces.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">o Organize coordination meetings for early recovery under the EPR and 3RP mechanisms to
provide advice to UN and 3RP partners and (where appropriate) governmental counterparts on
